OL,3,GNEWSAParents given e-scooter warning
OL,4,Aahead of Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn awareness campaign warning parents
OL,7,Fof the dangers of e-scooters has been
OL,8,Flaunched in the run-up to Christmas.
OL,10,FHumberside Police, along with the
OL,11,FOffice of the Police and Crime
OL,12,FCommissioner for Humberside, said the
OL,13,Fcampaign - Is it wheely worth it? -
OL,14,Faimed to educate children, parents and
OL,15,Fguardians about the dangers and legal
OL,16,Frestrictions surrounding e-scooters.
OL,18,FIt involves a social media campaign,
OL,19,Fdays of action, school visits and a
OL,20,Fcrackdown on those using e-scooters on
OL,21,Fpublic paths and roads.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
