OL,3,GNEWSAParents given e-scooter warning
OL,4,Aahead of Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Pete Musgrave said: "It's
OL,7,Fimportant people understand they are
OL,8,Fnot toys and there are strict laws
OL,9,Fgoverning their use."
